{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792103820, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T22:37:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T22:38:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792103880, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 27347, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "這幾年經常有機車停車格被塗掉，導致要停車時越來越難找到停車位，不曉得市長對於這件事有規劃嗎？謝謝！", "display_name": "中山代表 Bowen Hsu", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11333, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "交通意外太多，想減少交通意外！\n增加更多公車及加長服務時間，鼓勵減少駕駛汽/機車。", "display_name": "中山代表 Danny Chan", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42067, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "不要再砍樹了，把樹種回來\n不要再挖沒必要的下水道了", "display_name": "文山代表 No.42,067", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26838, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "不要整天靠北樹被修剪，那都是綠營原本的支持者才故意炒作。\n\n拉攏中間選民吧，我想看到的是二手菸的防治", "display_name": "文山代表 No.26,838", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T22:37:52+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29932, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "市政", "content": "讓現任市長上來平台看看，他有多失職！", "display_name": "信義代表 No.29,932", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 11333, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 Danny Chan", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 42067, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.42,067", "d